[size=4][b]Description[/b][/size]
[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]QuickPocket lets you swiftly steal your target's belongings without ever pausing the game. Crouch behind them, look at them, and earn yourself a five-finger discount![/color][/size]

[size=4][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]
[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]Supports Skyrim Special Edition [b]1.5.97[/b], Anniversary Edition through [b]1.7.104[/b], and [b]Skyrim VR[/b]. Use the SKSE and Address Library builds that match your game.

Reskins made for QuickLoot IE also work with QuickPocket, because QuickPocket reuses QuickLoot IE's loot menu.[/color][/size]

[size=4][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*][color=#D4D4D8][size=3]Install QuickLoot IE 4.1.1+ and its requirements using your favorite mod manager[/size][/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8][size=3]Install QuickPocket[/size][/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8][size=3][s]Wait fifteen minutes and endorse this mod[/s][/size][/color][/*]
[*][color=#D4D4D8][size=3]You're done![/size][/color][/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[size=3][color=#D4D4D8]QuickLoot IE 4.1.1+ and its requirements
[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/32444]Address Library for SKSE Plugins[/url] (SE/AE) or [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/58101]VR Address Library[/url] (VR)
[url=https://skse.silverlock.org/]SKSE[/url] matching your game version[/color][/size]

